            "type": "sum",
            "col": "amount"
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "依 category 與 subcategory 分組加總 amount；subcategory 空白歸 unspecified、大小寫不分且輸出用 lower，分組結果須與重算一致。",
      "required": true,
      "authority": "client",
      "hidden": false,
